/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (The year 2025 marked a period of growth, consolidation, and meaningful impact for WeCare Youth Organization. We strengthened our engagement in public finance governance, budget advocacy, and integrity programming, advancing youth participation in national decision-making processes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (Through budget hearings, legislative engagement, and policy advocacy, the organization contributed youth-centered and evidence-based perspectives to governance and social protection discussions. Strong partnerships with civil society and development partners supported the expansion of integrity and anti-corruption initiatives in higher education institutions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
